sequenceDiagram
    participant DB as Module schema
    participant Old as Old application
    participant New as New application
    participant Ops as Release operations

    Ops->>DB: Expand migration - additive and compatible
    DB-->>Ops: Validate required and compatible IDs
    Old->>DB: Continue old reads and writes
    Ops->>New: Deploy compatible consumer then producer
    New->>DB: Read old and new forms, write transition form
    Ops->>DB: Backfill with a separate resumable job
    New->>DB: Switch reads to new form
    Ops->>Old: Drain all old instances and backlog
    Ops->>DB: Contract migration after approval
    Note over DB,Ops: Image rollback never implies database Down
